  "description": "I-Jun ended things with his ex, Ha-eon, believing he was only after money. Two years later, Ha-eon reappears, broken and desperate, begging for another chance. Unable to resist his pretty face and body, I-Jun agrees to meet every Wednesday, but their encounters quickly become more complicated. Doubts and old wounds resurface, leaving I-Jun to wonder—can their toxic bond ever heal, or is it doomed to repeat itself?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
